{
 "describe": "TSMC monthly net revenue in millions of New Taiwan dollars, January 2002 to October 2026, as shown on the company's investor pages (one page per year) on 2026-11-22. The company shows unconsolidated figures for 2002-2012, consolidated figures from April 2006, and only consolidated figures from January 2013. yoy_pct is the page's own year-on-year change.",
 "point_in_time_note": "These are the values visible on the investor site on 2026-11-22, not the values first released: an early figure may have been restated since. The filing times in tsmc_monthly_revenue_events.json show when a release had been filed; they do not show that a value in this file appeared in that release. Use this file for exploratory analysis only. A historical point-in-time test needs each value taken from the dated release it relies on.",
 "source": "https://investor.tsmc.com/english/monthly-revenue/<year>",
 "transcription_checks": "Each year's months sum to the page's Total within rounding (at most 2), except 2006 consolidated, where the page shows a full-year total but months only from April. Stated year-on-year changes were compared with the figure twelve months earlier on the same basis. Those over 0.06 points follow; the 2013 ones coincide with the change of accounting basis that year: 2003-12 unconsolidated: stated 67.2%, computed 68.16%; 2007-06 consolidated: stated -5.4%, computed -5.55%; 2007-09 consolidated: stated 8.2%, computed 8.29%; 2013-01 consolidated: stated 37.1%, computed 37.23%; 2013-02 consolidated: stated 21.5%, computed 21.64%; 2013-03 consolidated: stated 18.9%, computed 19.01%; 2013-04 consolidated: stated 23.5%, computed 23.64%; 2013-05 consolidated: stated 17.2%, computed 17.33%; 2013-06 consolidated: stated 24.3%, computed 24.41%; 2013-07 consolidated: stated 7.3%, computed 7.37%; 2013-08 consolidated: stated 11.2%, computed 11.30%; 2013-09 consolidated: stated 27.6%, computed 27.75%; 2013-10 consolidated: stated 3.6%, computed 3.72%; 2013-11 consolidated: stated 0.1%, computed 0.17%; 2013-12 consolidated: stated 33.7%, computed 33.86%.",
